// Article 4. The trustee's duties.
#require "3-incapacity.charter".
Fact asset Identified by Cottage

Prohibited mix-with-own-property Actor person

Event year-ends
Duty annual-account Holder person Claimant beneficiary
  Due within 60 days
Act account Actor trustee
  Holds when True
  Terminates (Foreach beneficiary: annual-account(trustee, beneficiary))
Extend Event year-ends
  Creates (Foreach person, beneficiary: annual-account(person, beneficiary) When trustee(person))

Fact consented Identified by beneficiary * asset
Act consent-to-sale Actor beneficiary Related to asset
  Holds when True
  Creates consented(beneficiary, asset)
Fact sold-to-trustee Identified by asset
Power buy-from-trust Actor trustee Related to asset
  Valid when (Forall beneficiary: consented(beneficiary, asset))
  Creates sold-to-trustee(asset)

Clause 4.1 => mix-with-own-property
Clause 4.2 => year-ends, annual-account, account
Clause 4.3 => beneficiary, buy-from-trust, consent-to-sale.
